    "findings": [
      "native runs: source <snapshot>; shopt -u extglob; eval '<cmd>' < /dev/null && pwd -P >| <cwd file>",
      "stdout and stderr share one stream in write order; a character split around a stderr write decodes as replacement characters",
      "results are trimmed; empty reads '(Bash completed with no output)'; failures read 'Exit code N' plus output",
      "over 30,000 characters: <persisted-output> with a 2 KB preview; a cwd reset line follows the block",
      "failure text: output capped at 30,000, message kept to first and last 5,000 with '... [N characters truncated] ...'",
      "cwd persists inside the project, resets outside with 'Shell cwd was reset to <project>'; a failed command does not move it; exports and functions do not persist",
      "timeout auto-backgrounds the command; background and timeout texts promise a completion notification"
    ]
  },
